      ],
      "text": "The instant revision has been filed by M / s Victor Component Systems Pvt . Ltd. challenging the demand notice dated 27-06-2023 issued by the Respondent Authority , whereby time extension charges have been levied . The Revisionist does not deny that the time extension charges are payable by him . His only prayer is limited to the fact that the time extension charges should be applicable from the outer limit for construction as mentioned in the lease deed . It is a settled position of law that once a binding contract is entered between the parties , one party cannot unilaterally alter the conditions of the"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        126.58,
        440.07,
        170.68,
        440.07,
        170.68,
        447.98,
        126.58,
        447.98
      ],
      "text": "contract ."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        125.86,
        460.93,
        517.81,
        460.93,
        517.81,
        517.05,
        125.86,
        517.05
      ],
      "text": "The Respondent Authority agrees to this contention of the Revisionist . The Revision is disposed of with a direction to the Authority to recalculate the time extension charges as per the conditions mentioned in the lease deed ."
